      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A new layer digest does not make all bytes new. Chunk hashes expose reusable content inside that layer.\nThis is an independent lab CDC format, not native Docker registry delta support.\nCompression, tar metadata and chunk-boundary effects are measured rather than assumed.",
      "originalText": "A new layer digest does not make all bytes new. Chunk hashes expose reusable content inside that layer.\nThis is an independent lab CDC format, not native Docker registry delta support.\nCompression, tar metadata and chunk-boundary effects are measured rather than assumed.",
